# SETTINGS (GLO, then GLO again): the whole screen, a list; knob 1 moves, knob 2 sets. It stays until HOME.
# Voices: POLY, MONO, LEGATO, UNISON (part of the sound). Tempo: one for all (a new beat keeps it) or each
# beat's own. The room's sound. The auto-bass on or off, and its way. All of it kept over a restart.
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 1000
tap GLO
expect page 7
expect latch 1
shot 00_settings.png
# VOICES: MONO, then two notes: one voice
spin K2 1
expect par63 1
midi 90 3c 64
midi 90 40 64
wait 200
expect voices 1
wait 100
shot 01_mono.png
midi 80 40 00
midi 80 3c 00
wait 600
# UNISON: one note, four voices
spin K2 2
expect par63 3
midi 90 3c 64
wait 200
expect voices >3
midi 80 3c 00
wait 600
spin K2 1
expect par63 0
# TEMPO: one for all: a new beat keeps it
spin K1 2
expect par64 0
spin SELECT 1
wait 200
expect par25 84
spin SELECT -1
wait 200
# each beat's own: a new beat brings its tempo
spin K2 1
expect par64 1
spin SELECT 1
wait 200
expect par25 !84
spin K2 1
expect par64 0
# ROOM: the city at night
spin K1 1
spin K2 2
expect par65 2
wait 100
shot 02_room.png
# AUTO BASS off, then ROOT
spin K1 2
spin K2 1
expect par66 0
spin K1 1
spin K2 1
expect par67 1
wait 100
shot 03_bass.png
# it stays until HOME
wait 4000
expect page 7
tap HOME
expect latch 0
wait 6000
reboot
wait 500
expect par65 2
expect par66 0
expect par67 1
